    {
      "definition_json": {
        "description": "REQ-700 / GH #3737. The header of a count order (inventory taking): one org unit, a kind (full or selective), the planned period, the chair, a status and the issued document. status is draft, ordered, counting, counted, signed, posted or cancelled. org_unit_id is the scope column (decision 0076 R7). Master references (org unit, employee) are record ids checked in code (0076 R6), not foreign keys. cut_off_at and cutoff_seq are filled by REQ-701.",
        "display_name": "Count order",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "org_unit_id",
            "queried": true,
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
